155
00:28:16,640 --> 00:28:23,440
This arises as a way for the model to keep the residual stream from growing out of control. From this insight, he was able to recover the right pairings.

156
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:31,680
For ordering, Shawn noticed that the model seemed to improve if he sorted the blocks by the size of their residual contributions. Starting with that rough approximation,

157
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:39,120
he combined a clever ranking heuristic with local swaps to recover the exact right order. His full walkthrough is linked in the description.

